# v0.29.0 — post-v0.28.0 work (staging draft)

**Baseline**: the `v0.28.0` staging log names commits through ~27 Oct 2026
(newest named: `e8dc0c272`). Sections below collect commits accrued on
`main` after that cutoff — 2026-10-27 → 2026-11-10, ~1,140 commits.
**Tag**: `v0.29.0` (pending — staging draft; per-commit placement is a
proposal pending the operator's release-placement ruling, same convention
as the v0.26.0/v0.28.0 collections).
**Drafted**: 2026-11-10 (release-notes freshness pass, item 30).

> **Coverage caveat**: this is a *biggest-gaps* draft, not the exhaustive
> per-commit collection the tagged logs carry. The full window is ~1,140
> commits; the sections below name the dominant families with their
> principal commits. A complete `git log` sweep against this file is still
> owed before the tag.

