- `5a2844d0d` — S0: domain-separated signing primitives +
  `consensus_domain_separation_height` (inert).
- `7e3d6d1f7` — S1: domain-gated sign/verify at proposal + attestation
  sites (inert below activation).
- `57bfbaccd` — S2: evidence-store `signature_domain` + attestation-lock
  journal.
- `ca16b6836` — S3: acceptance-key domain components + dual-accept window.
- `3da65ad7a` + `e3775f8b5` — T1–T22 domain-separation matrix; T13/T18w
  dual-accept legs un-skipped.
- `9e63ba4ba` — T15: shared attestation-lock lapse constant, height-gated.
- `2dc1ad9e0` — T7a/T14: unconditional round authentication post-H.
- `cc3ec1f62` — persist domain-keyed signed attestations by record height.
- `f68e537a4`, `da738422b`, `473c4f18f`, `962d0d293`, `c97b91f83`,
